OL,3,AMushroom murderer trial undermined by
OL,4,A'catastrophic' hotel mix-up, appeal
OL,5,Acourt told
OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers for Australian mushroom
OL,8,Fmurderer Erin Patterson say her
OL,9,Fconviction was undermined by a
OL,10,F"catastrophic" mix-up that led to the
OL,11,Fjury staying at the same hotel as
OL,12,Fprosecutors and a key witness.
OL,14,FPatterson is serving a life sentence
OL,15,Fafter killing three of her relatives
OL,16,Fand trying to kill another by serving
OL,17,Fthem a beef Wellington containing death
OL,18,Fcap mushrooms at her Victoria home in
OL,19,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
